@page "/about"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Why Hana | EMS + OSAT microelectronics manufacturing";
    ViewData["Motion"] = "page";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Why Hana: semiconductor assembly and test (OSAT) and electronics manufacturing (EMS) in one independent company, listed on the Stock Exchange of Thailand since 1993.";
}
@section Head {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/about.css" />
}

@* Why Hana (About overview). Static content; page CSS in ~/css/about.css;
   section backgrounds via ~/js/hana-backgrounds.js. *@

<div data-density="compact">
<!-- ── Breadcrumb ── -->
  <div class="subbar">
    <div class="subbar-inner">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span>
        <span>Why Hana</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="meta">EMS · OSAT · Est. 1978</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Hero ── -->
  <section class="hero" id="wh-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-accent="cyan" data-fade="left">
    <div class="hero-photo" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/hq-cover.webp" alt=""/></div>
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h1>Why Hana Group</h1>
      <p class="hero-summary">
        Hana brings semiconductor assembly and test together with full electronics manufacturing: OSAT and EMS in one independent, publicly listed company,
        across four countries. Specialized in microelectronics since 1978.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary">Contact us</a>
        <a href="/capabilities" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary">Explore capabilities</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Vision & Mission (light) ── -->
  <section class="band vm-band" id="wh-vm" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-accent="cyan" data-fade="none">
    <div class="band-inner">
      <div class="vm-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="pillar-label">Vision</div>
          <p class="vm-text">To be the electronics manufacturing services partner of choice, delivering high-quality microelectronics manufacturing across a
            broad field of related disciplines.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="pillar-label">Mission</div>
          <p class="vm-text">To build long-term value for shareholders, customers, and employees through strong customer satisfaction, the wellbeing of our
            people, responsible environmental and social practices, and a culture of
            innovation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Pillar 1 — Vertical integration ── -->
  <section class="band vi-band">
    <div class="band-inner">
      <div class="vi-head">
        <h2>Vertically Integrated Operations</h2>
        <p>Many manufacturers can do one or the other but Hana does both. OSAT (outsourced semiconductor assembly and test) packages and tests the chips. EMS (electronics manufacturing services) builds the circuit boards and finished products around them. With both inside one company, a product that needs chip-level packaging and board-level assembly can move through both without leaving Hana.</p>
        <p>For a buyer, that means fewer suppliers to qualify and manage, design and
          intellectual property kept within a single organization, and closer control
          over quality, cost, and schedule.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="vi-flow-wrap" role="img" aria-label="Vertical integration flow: IC packaging and test (OSAT) through board assembly (EMS) to box build and fulfillment — seven stages on one site.">
        <div class="vi-flow">

          <div class="vi-phase">
            <div class="vi-rail">
              <div class="vi-rail-label"><span class="vi-rail-tag">OSAT</span><span class="vi-rail-name">IC packaging &amp; test</span></div>
              <div class="vi-rail-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="vi-steps">
              <div class="vi-card">
                <div class="vi-step">Step 01</div>
                <div class="vi-name">Wafer BG &amp; Saw</div>
                <ul class="vi-ops"><li>BG</li><li>Saw</li></ul>
              </div>
              <div class="vi-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="18" viewBox="0 0 22 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 9 H18"/><path d="M12 3 L19 9 L12 15"/></svg></div>
              <div class="vi-card">
                <div class="vi-step">Step 02</div>
                <div class="vi-name">IC Assembly</div>
                <ul class="vi-ops"><li>DA</li><li>WB</li><li>Molding</li></ul>
              </div>
              <div class="vi-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="18" viewBox="0 0 22 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 9 H18"/><path d="M12 3 L19 9 L12 15"/></svg></div>
              <div class="vi-card">
                <div class="vi-step">Step 03</div>
                <div class="vi-name">Test</div>
                <ul class="vi-ops"><li>O/S test</li><li>Tape &amp; reel</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="vi-arrow vi-arrow--phase" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="34" height="22" viewBox="0 0 38 22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 11 H33"/><path d="M25 4 L34 11 L25 18"/></svg></div>

          <div class="vi-phase">
            <div class="vi-rail">
              <div class="vi-rail-label"><span class="vi-rail-tag">EMS</span><span class="vi-rail-name">Board assembly</span></div>
              <div class="vi-rail-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="vi-steps">
              <div class="vi-card">
                <div class="vi-step">Step 04</div>
                <div class="vi-name">SMT / COB</div>
                <ul class="vi-ops"><li>Screen print</li><li>P&amp;P</li><li>Reflow</li><li>COB</li></ul>
              </div>
              <div class="vi-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="18" viewBox="0 0 22 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 9 H18"/><path d="M12 3 L19 9 L12 15"/></svg></div>
              <div class="vi-card">
                <div class="vi-step">Step 05</div>
                <div class="vi-name">PCBA</div>
                <ul class="vi-ops"><li>Placement</li><li>Soldering</li><li>ICT &amp; FCT</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="vi-arrow vi-arrow--phase" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="34" height="22" viewBox="0 0 38 22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 11 H33"/><path d="M25 4 L34 11 L25 18"/></svg></div>

          <div class="vi-phase">
            <div class="vi-rail">
              <div class="vi-rail-label"><span class="vi-rail-tag">FULFILL</span><span class="vi-rail-name">Box build &amp; fulfillment</span></div>
              <div class="vi-rail-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="vi-steps">
              <div class="vi-card">
                <div class="vi-step">Step 06</div>
                <div class="vi-name">Box Build</div>
                <ul class="vi-ops"><li>Cover assembly</li><li>Housing assembly</li></ul>
              </div>
              <div class="vi-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="18" viewBox="0 0 22 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 9 H18"/><path d="M12 3 L19 9 L12 15"/></svg></div>
              <div class="vi-card">
                <div class="vi-step">Step 07</div>
                <div class="vi-name">Drop Ship</div>
                <ul class="vi-ops"><li>EXW</li><li>DDU</li><li>FOB</li></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        <svg class="vi-feedback-svg" width="845" height="40" viewBox="0 0 845 40" style="position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 48px; overflow: visible;" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <marker id="vi-feedback-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="7" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
              <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 Z" fill="var(--hana-blue-deep)"></path>
            </marker>
          </defs>
          <path d="M706,10 L706,22 Q706,34 694,34 L84,34 Q72,34 72,22 L72,10" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue-deep)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1 6" marker-end="url(#vi-feedback-arrow)"></path>
          <path d="M552,34 L552,10" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue-deep)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1 6" marker-end="url(#vi-feedback-arrow)"></path>
          <path d="M374,34 L374,10" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue-deep)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1 6" marker-end="url(#vi-feedback-arrow)"></path>
          <path d="M220,34 L220,10" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue-deep)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1 6" marker-end="url(#vi-feedback-arrow)"></path>
        </svg>
        <div class="vi-feedback-label" style="position: absolute; left: 386px; bottom: 15px; transform: translate(-50%, 50%); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hana-blue-deep); background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--hana-blue-tint); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; white-space: nowrap;">DFx &amp; JDM feedback loop</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="vi-points">
        <li>
          <span class="vi-point-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Continual technology investment</strong>
            <p>Ongoing investment in manufacturing machinery, including patented Hana manufacturing systems keep Hana at the forefront of electronics manufacturing methods.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="vi-point-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Diverse Capability Skillsets</strong>
            <p>Our range of skills gives us a wider view on how to approach manufacturing and what pathways to take to achieve the best and most efficient results.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="vi-point-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Manufacturing Flexibility</strong>
            <p>From high-volume, low-mix lines to low-volume, high-mix programs, matched to what you build.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="vi-point-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          <div>
            <strong>NPI to full production</strong>
            <p>New product introduction through to mass production runs under one company increasing time to market drastically</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Pillar 2 — Geographic resilience ── -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="band-inner">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div>
          <h2>Manufacturing across four countries</h2>
          <p>Our global manufacturing footprint within Hana gives customers opportunities for program to be dual-sourced across borders without changing suppliers, closer to final markets and adaptable to different wage and technological requirements between countries.</p>
          <p>Hana gives customers room to manage regional risk (tariffs, demand swings and supply disruption), including a domestic option in the United States and TAA compliant manufacturing in Cambodia.</p>
          <div class="pillar-cta"><a href="/locations" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary">Explore locations</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="aside">
          <div class="rows">
            <div class="row"><span class="k">China</span><span class="v">Jiaxing</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Thailand</span><span class="v">Ayutthaya  /  Lamphun</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Cambodia</span><span class="v">Koh Kong</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">United States</span><span class="v">Ohio </span></div>
            
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Pillar 3 — Track record ── -->
  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="band-inner">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div>
          <h2>Building microelectronics since 1978</h2>
          <p>Hana started in Bangkok in 1978 and has been listed on the Stock Exchange
            of Thailand since 1993. It is independent with a diverse customer profile
            throughout operations which means stability, transparency, and decisions made
            for the long term.</p>
          <p>Many customer relationships run more than twenty years. In contract
            manufacturing, that continuity is the clearest signal that the work holds
            up.</p>
          <div class="pillar-cta"><a href="/investor-relations" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary">Explore investor relations</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="aside">
          <figure class="tr-shot">
            <img src="/images/jiaxing-facility.webp" alt="Inside a Hana facility" style="width:100%;height:210px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);display:block;">
            <figcaption>Inside a Hana facility</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="rows">
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Revenues</span><span class="v">+$700M USD</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Listed</span><span class="v">SET, since 1993</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Independence</span><span class="v">Publicly listed</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Footprint</span><span class="v">Four countries</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Relationships</span><span class="v">Many 20+ years</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Pillar 4 — Markets served ── -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="band-inner">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div>
          <h2>Proven and diversified across demanding industries</h2>
          <p>Hana isn't tied to one market sector, but builds for the world electronics market including some of the most stringent in terms of quality and performance such as automotive and medical. We are diversified across 10 major global markets to ensure we remain resilient to economic and technological changes going on in each market segment.</p>
          <p>Work across regulated, high-reliability industries keeps the quality systems and processes exercised against real requirements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="aside">
          <div class="rows rows--markets">
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/automotive">Automotive <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/industrial-iot">Industrial &amp; IoT <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/telecom">Telecommunications <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/rfid">RFID <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/optical-sensors">Optical &amp; Sensors <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/consumer">Consumer Electronics <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/medical">Medical <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/access-control">Access Control <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/power-management">Power Management <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a class="m-row" href="/markets/data-centers">Data Centers <span class="m-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<style>
    details.ab-faq{ border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
    details.ab-faq:first-child{ border-top:none; }
    details.ab-faq > summary{ list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:18px 22px; display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; font-family:var(--font-text); font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.4; }
    details.ab-faq > summary::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }
    details.ab-faq[open] > summary{ background:var(--bg); }
    .ab-faq-mk{ color:var(--hana-blue); font-size:22px; line-height:1; flex-shrink:0; transition:transform 150ms ease; }
    details.ab-faq[open] .ab-faq-mk{ transform:rotate(45deg); }
    .ab-faq-a{ padding:0 22px 20px; font-family:var(--font-text); font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.65; max-width:720px; }
  </style>
  <!-- ── FAQ: company facts in question form (structured data is generated from it) ── -->
  <section class="band band--white" id="wh-faq">
    <div class="band-inner">
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 24px;">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;max-width:860px;">
      <details class="ab-faq" open>
        <summary>What is Hana Microelectronics?<span class="ab-faq-mk" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="ab-faq-a">Hana Microelectronics is an electronics manufacturing services (EMS) and outsourced semiconductor assembly and test (OSAT) company headquartered in Bangkok, Thailand. It was founded in 1978 and manufactures for its customers at plants in Thailand, China, Cambodia and the USA.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="ab-faq">
        <summary>Is Hana Microelectronics a publicly listed company?<span class="ab-faq-mk" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="ab-faq-a">Yes. Hana Microelectronics Public Company Limited has been listed on the Stock Exchange of Thailand since 1993 under the ticker HANA, and it operates as an independent company.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="ab-faq">
        <summary>Where does Hana manufacture?<span class="ab-faq-mk" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="ab-faq-a">At five plants: Lamphun and Ayutthaya in Thailand, Jiaxing in China, Koh Kong in Cambodia and Solon, Ohio in the USA. A program can be dual-sourced from more than one country within the same company, with each plant qualified separately against the customer's requirements.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="ab-faq">
        <summary>What is the difference between EMS and OSAT, and does Hana do both?<span class="ab-faq-mk" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="ab-faq-a">OSAT covers packaging and testing semiconductor die as finished ICs. EMS covers assembling components onto circuit boards and building those boards into finished products. Hana does both within one company, so a device can be packaged, tested and then built into a board or product by the same manufacturer.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="ab-faq">
        <summary>How many people work at Hana?<span class="ab-faq-mk" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="ab-faq-a">Around 7,500 people across Hana's plants and offices.</div>
      </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Closing removed ── -->
</div>
